    "detailed_description": "<h1>DEMO COMING SOON, WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p>Hello you nice noir people! We are currently working on a really cool improved and full-featured DEMO for you to download and play. Meanwhile. you can wishlist the game! Stay tuned, see you under the storm.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/b064bfed3b968a20c1a64184187aaf8f.poster.avif?t=1699899924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/b064bfed3b968a20c1a64184187aaf8f.webm?t=1699899924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/b064bfed3b968a20c1a64184187aaf8f.mp4?t=1699899924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NOIR STORM IS...</h2>a Point &amp; Click <strong>adventure game</strong> with aesthetics and narrative inspired by <strong>Film Noir</strong>, real history, and <i>classic adventures</i> of the 90's.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE PLOT:</h2>You will join Daniel Leone, a <strong>private investigator in 1952\u00b4s</strong>  Buenos Aires city. <strong>His partner, Martinez, has been missing for several days.</strong> When Daniel follows the only lead he has and is almost killed, he will discover that Martinez has been involved in matters far out of his league.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE SETTING:</h2>With a musical and visual setting typical of the 50s, <i>solve the challenges of a classic adventure game</i>. <strong>Gather clues</strong> with Leone's <i>notebook</i> and follow the trail to the end of his dangerous adventure. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/193fab23340257864f083a9436dd5146.poster.avif?t=1699899924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/193fab23340257864f083a9436dd5146.webm?t=1699899924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/193fab23340257864f083a9436dd5146.mp4?t=1699899924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/e3dc7086d0780cd14e035a3e607358c0.poster.avif?t=1699899924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/e3dc7086d0780cd14e035a3e607358c0.webm?t=1699899924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/e3dc7086d0780cd14e035a3e607358c0.mp4?t=1699899924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/ab6b1032678fc14bc6a656725aa2affe.poster.avif?t=1699899924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/ab6b1032678fc14bc6a656725aa2affe.webm?t=1699899924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/ab6b1032678fc14bc6a656725aa2affe.mp4?t=1699899924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Classic point &amp; click adventure game inspired by Film Noir.<br></li><li> Narrative fueled by real locations, characters, historical investigations, and real warlike elements of the time.<br></li><li>Meet deep characters through conversations, collect items, solve puzzles, and combine clues and data in your notebook to advance in the investigation.<br></li><li>Pixelart art and animation accompanied by unique comic illustrations.<br></li><li>Find out what happened with the Nazis in South America (<i>based on real investigations of the well-known argentinian journalist and writer Abel Basti</i>)<br></li><li>Rain, rain everywhere! It's a storm after all...</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/fd2fe24894b395eae03dbf5227a9ecfc.poster.avif?t=1699899924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/fd2fe24894b395eae03dbf5227a9ecfc.webm?t=1699899924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/fd2fe24894b395eae03dbf5227a9ecfc.mp4?t=1699899924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/678245e2d1c946ca6315aa15971b1fb3.poster.avif?t=1699899924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/678245e2d1c946ca6315aa15971b1fb3.webm?t=1699899924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845980/extras/678245e2d1c946ca6315aa15971b1fb3.mp4?t=1699899924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
